  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players draw from the stock or claim the discard.\n2. **Battle**: If multiple players want the discard, there is a priority system (usually the next player in order has first right).\n3. **Melding**: - **Sets**: 3 or 4 cards of the same rank. - **Runs**: 3+ consecutive cards of the same suit (Cyclic: K-A-2 is allowed). - **Sevens**: A single 7 can be melded alone.\n4. **Blast**: Winning with a specific combination involving 7s or a clean sweep of the hand recorded as a 'Blast' (double points).",
    Player: "1. Players draw from the stock or claim the discard.\n2. **Battle**: If multiple players want the discard, there is a priority system (usually the next player in order has first right).\n3. **Melding**: - **Sets**: 3 or 4 cards of the same rank. - **Runs**: 3+ consecutive cards of the same suit (Cyclic: K-A-2 is allowed). - **Sevens**: A single 7 can be melded alone.\n4. **Blast**: Winning with a specific combination involving 7s or a clean sweep of the hand recorded as a 'Blast' (double points).",
    objective: "Win by melding all cards in your hand or having the lowest point total when someone 'knocks'.",
    gameplay: "1. Players draw from the stock or claim the discard.\n2. **Battle**: If multiple players want the discard, there is a priority system (usually the next player in order has first right).\n3. **Melding**: - **Sets**: 3 or 4 cards of the same rank. - **Runs**: 3+ consecutive cards of the same suit (Cyclic: K-A-2 is allowed). - **Sevens**: A single 7 can be melded alone.\n4. **Blast**: Winning with a specific combination involving 7s or a clean sweep of the hand recorded as a 'Blast' (double points).",
